auth.description:
1. Open this URL in a browser and log in:

{authorize_url}

2. After login your browser will refuse to open the final `miele://oauth2-code/?code=...` link — that is expected and means it worked. Copy that whole `miele://...` URL and paste it below. (If it vanishes, open DevTools → Network → Preserve log and grab the last blocked `miele://` request.)
